        <template id="custom_web_box_external_layout" inherit_id="web.external_layout_boxed">
            <xpath expr="//div[@class='col-6 text-end mb4']" position="replace"></xpath>
            <xpath expr="//div[@t-attf-class='footer o_boxed_footer o_company_#{company.id}_layout']" position="replace">
                <style>

                    .footer-line {
                    border-width: 1px; /* Adjust border thickness as needed */
                    border-style: solid; /* Ensure border style is set */
                    border-color: black; /* Define border color as per your design */
                    font-weight: normal; /* Ensure normal font weight */
                    }

                </style>

                <div t-attf-class="footer o_company_#{company.id}_layout">
                    <hr class="footer-line" />
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <div t-field="company.report_footer" />
                        <div t-if="report_type == 'pdf'"> Page: <span class="page" /> / <span
                                class="topage" />
                        </div>
                        <div t-if="report_type == 'pdf' and display_name_in_footer"
                            class="text-muted">
                            <span t-field="o.name" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </xpath>
        </template>

        <template id="report_sales_cover_letter">
            <t t-call="web.external_layout">
                <div class="page" style="page-break-after:always">
                    <div class="col-4" style="font-size: 18px;">
                        <div t-field="doc.partner_id" t-options="{'widget': 'contact', 'fields': ['address', 'name', 'phone', 'email'], 'no_marker': True, 'phone_icons': True}"/>
                        <p t-if="doc.partner_id.vat"><t t-out="doc.company_id.account_fiscal_country_id.vat_label or 'GST NO'"/>: <span t-field="doc.partner_id.vat"/></p>
                    </div><br/><br/>
                    
                    <span style="font-size: 18px;">Dear <t t-esc="doc.partner_id.name"/>,</span><br/><br/>
                    
                    <span style="font-size: 18px;">We, at Bar Code India (BCI), are thrilled about the opportunity to partner with you. At BCI, our core mission is to collaborate with esteemed organizations like yours, to unlock excellence by driving efficiency, ensuring quality, and fostering sustainability across their manufacturing and supply chains.</span><br/><br/>
                    
                    <span style="font-size: 18px;">Over the past 25 years, we have successfully executed more than 2000 projects in India's Manufacturing, Retail, Transport and Logistics, and Government sectors. Our extensive and diverse portfolio of supply chain solutions, encompassing both hardware and software domains, is unparalleled. Our greatest strength lies in our team of over 250 adept technology specialists located across 9 offices spanning India. Our team possesses comprehensive expertise in Barcoding, RFID, IoT, Automation, WLAN, and Supply Chain Software, including but not limited to Warehouse Management, Manufacturing Execution Systems, and Asset Intelligence.</span><br/><br/>
                    
                    <span style="font-size: 18px;">We are confident that we can design, create, and implement the right solution to meet your needs. Enclosed herewith, please find comprehensive details of our proposed engagement for the discussed project.</span><br/><br/>
                    
                    <span style="font-size: 18px;">We understand the criticality of our solutions deployed within your operations, and as such, our principles are anchored in an unwavering commitment to customer-centricity. If you have any inquiries or concerns at any point, please do not hesitate to contact me directly. We at BCI are excited to embark on this collaborative journey as part of your digital transformation.</span><br/><br/>
                    
                    <span style="font-size: 18px;">Best regards,</span><br/><br/>
                    
                    <div class="col-6" style="font-size: 18px;">
                        <t t-esc="doc.user_id.name"/>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </t>
        </template>

        <template id="report_sale_order_with_cover_letter">
            <t t-call="web.html_container">
                <t t-foreach="docs" t-as="doc">
                    <t t-if="doc.bci_stage == 'approved'">
                        <t t-call="barcode_india.report_sales_cover_letter"/>
                        <t t-call="sale.report_saleorder_document" t-lang="doc.partner_id.lang"/>
                    </t>
                    <t t-else="">
                        <t t-call="web.external_layout">
                            <div class="page">
                                <div style="margin-top: 300px;">
                                    <p style="text-align: center;">This Quotation is not approved and cannot be printed.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </t>
                    </t>
                </t>
            </t>
        </template>

        <template id="bci_report_saleorder_with_condition" inherit_id="sale.report_saleorder">
            <xpath expr="//t[@t-foreach='docs']" position="replace">
                <t t-foreach="docs" t-as="doc">
                    <t t-if="doc.bci_stage == 'approved'">
                        <t t-call="sale.report_saleorder_document" t-lang="doc.partner_id.lang"/>
                    </t>
                    <t t-else="">
                        <t t-call="web.external_layout">
                            <div class="page">
                                <div style="margin-top: 300px;">
                                    <p style="text-align: center;">This Quotation is not approved and cannot be printed.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </t>
